====================================================================================================
  d(sigma_MG)/d(infall-phase y) = 0 identically (any a0, any interpolation): the MG EFE is
  a function of the CURRENT position only; infall phase labels the tracer and appears
  NOWHERE in the internal dynamics. Verified symbolically.
  numeric: MG relational spread = 0 across infall phases for a0 x {0.5,1,2}. THEOREM (field
